  "identifier": "heudiconv",
  "name": "HeuDiConv",
  "alternateName": [
    "Heuristic DICOM Converter"
  ],
  "description": "Heuristic-driven DICOM-to-BIDS converter for neuroimaging. Converts raw DICOM acquisitions into BIDS-compliant datasets using customisable Python heuristic scripts that control file naming and directory organisation. Integrates with dcm2niix for fast NIfTI conversion and DataLad for versioned data management. The ReproIn heuristic supports both prospective (scanner-side naming) and retrospective conversions. Widely used in multi-site neuroimaging studies and reproducible research pipelines. Maintained by the nipy community.",
